{"ID":"20240118151030-03v36u8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151030-03v36u8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151030-03v36u8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151030-qt4f4j6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122150644-7jf5sv5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122150644-7jf5sv5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:101,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:101\u0026#125;","title":"269鸢尾","type":"doc","updated":"20240202163159"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151030-qt4f4j6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151030-qt4f4j6","updated":"20240122150643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，有毒。治蛊毒，邪气，鬼疰，诸毒。破症瘕，积聚，去水，下三虫。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122150643-rhgj4g1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122150643-rhgj4g1"}},{"ID":"20240122150644-7jf5sv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122150644-7jf5sv5","updated":"20240202163159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二百六十九，鸢尾，这个字念yuan尾，是个植物的名称，跟射干我们后面说的射ye干是同一类的，而在这里呢大家看一看就好了，我们没有用它，我们后面的射ye干，射ye干是第278位，还没有到。"}]}]}